      "Collector's Album-Limited Edition\nSTEREO\nSL-6687\nSEASONS GREETINGS\nfrom\nAmericanAirlines\nHark, The Herald Angels Sing!\nIt's the Christmas season once again, the most inspiring,\nthe most meaningful time of the year.\nO Come All Ye Faithful!\nIt is a time for families to gather, for friends to assemble.\nIt is a time for worship, a period of holiness. And more than\nany other time the yuletide is a time for a very special kind\nof music.\nThis edition of \"SEASONS (REETINGS\" tastefully combines\nthe reverent and dignified traditional melodies of the season\nwith the joyous, contemporary songs, and each selection is\nperformed by the most gifted and popular artists on record.\nSuperbly recorded in stereophonic sound, \"SEASONS GREETINGS\"\nprovides just the right holiday spirit.\nHave a merry, merry!!\nSide One\nJINGLE BELLS\nTony Sandler and Ralph Young\nO COME ALL YE FAITHFUL\nAl Martino\nI HEARD THE BELLS ON CHRISTMAS DAY\nThe Voices Of Christmas\nTHE LITTLE DRUMMER BOY\nDavid Rose's Orchestra\nSILENT NIGHT\nNat King Cole\nSide Two\nTHE CHRISTMAS TREE\nDavid Rose's Orchestra\nIT CAME UPON A MIDNIGHT CLEAR\nElla Fitzgerald\nLITTLE ALTAR BOY\nGlen Campbell\nWHITE CHRISTMAS\nPeggy Lee\nHARK THE HERALD ANGELS SING\nThe Hollywood Bowl Symphony Orchestra\n(Conducted by Carmen Dragon)\nProgrammed by DAVE DEXTER. IR.\nsee Ca A CA SS. . HOLD AND VINE STREETS, HOLLYWOOD, CALIFORNIA. FACTORIES: LOS ANGELES, CALIFORNIA, SCRANTON, PA., JACKSONVILLE, ILLINOIS, WINCHESTER, VIRGINI"
    ],
